<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - STOCKS TRADING EX-DIV MONDAY.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - STOCKS TRADING EX-DIV MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>shares of Selonda Aquaculture , Alysida ,</p>
<p>Xylemboria and Mills Sarantopoulos will trade</p>
<p>ex-dividend on Monday.</p>
<p>    Company	 Dividend/share  Coupon   Ex-div opening price</p>
<p>    Selonda	 30 drachmas	 4	    1,705</p>
<p>    Alysida	 42 drachmas	 6	    587   common</p>
<p>							     617   preferred</p>
<p>    Xylemboria    72 drachmas	 3	    1,288 common</p>
<p>							     1,843 preferred</p>
<p>    Sarantopoulos 16 dachmas	  39	   2,304</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
